## 📋 Step 7: Common Validations Cheat Sheet

### String Validation
```javascript
body('field')
  .trim()                    // Remove whitespace
  .isLength({ min: 1, max: 100 })  // Length check
  .matches(/^[a-zA-Z ]+$/)   // Pattern match
  .withMessage('Custom error')
```

### Email Validation
```javascript
body('email')
  .trim()
  .isEmail()
  .normalizeEmail()          // Convert to lowercase
  .withMessage('Invalid email')
```

### Number Validation
```javascript
query('limit')
  .isInt({ min: 1, max: 100 })
  .withMessage('Must be 1-100')
```

### Enum Validation
```javascript
query('sort')
  .isIn(['id', 'name', 'email'])
  .withMessage('Invalid sort field')
```

### Optional Fields
```javascript
body('optionalField')
  .optional()                // Skip if not provided
  .isString()
  .withMessage('Must be string if provided')
```

